msgid "triton-to-annotation"
msgstr "triton-to-annotation"

msgid "处理Ascend NPU特有的编译提示指令 (`extension.compile_hint`)，将其转换为后端的Annotation方言，用于指导后续的硬件特定优化或资源配置。"
msgstr "Handle Ascend NPU-specific compilation hint directives (`tl.compile_hint`), converting them into the backend's Annotation dialect to guide subsequent hardware-specific optimizations or resource allocation."

msgid "TritonAnnotationConversion"
msgstr "TritonAnnotationConversion"

msgid "将 `triton::AnnotationOp` 转换为 `annotation::MarkOp`，实现高级编译提示信息向底层注释标记的传递。"
msgstr "Translate `triton::AnnotationOp` to `annotation::MarkOp`, enabling the propagation of high-level compilation hints to low-level annotation markers."

msgid "triton-to-hfusion"
msgstr "triton-to-hfusion"

msgid "将Triton中的`TTIR`转换为Ascend NPU硬件加速器`HFusion`方言中的对应操作。"
msgstr "Convert `TTIR` in Triton to the corresponding operation in the `HFusion` dialect of the Ascend NPU hardware accelerator."

msgid "TritonHistogramToHFusionConversion"
msgstr "TritonHistogramToHFusionConversion"

msgid "将 `triton::HistogramOp` 转换为 `hfusion::HistogramOp`，使其能在NPU的专用硬件上高效执行。"
msgstr "Convert `triton::HistogramOp` to `hfusion::HistogramOp` so that it can execute efficiently on the dedicated hardware of the NPU."

msgid "triton-to-hivm"
msgstr "triton-to-hivm"

msgid "处理Triton的块同步操作 (`extension.sync_block_all`, `extension.sync_block_set`, `extension.sync_block_wait`)，将其转换为Ascend NPU的`HIVM`方言中的跨核心同步指令。这些指令用于管理多核流水线中的同步与数据依赖，是流水优化的关键。"
msgstr "Handle Triton's block synchronization operations (`tl.sync_block_all`, `tl.sync_block_set`, `tl.sync_block_wait`), converting them into cross-core synchronization instructions in Ascend NPU's `HIVM` dialect. These instructions are used to manage synchronization and data dependencies in multi-core pipelines, and are key to pipeline optimization."

msgid "TritonCustomOpToHIVMSyncOpConversion"
msgstr "TritonCustomOpToHIVMSyncOpConversion"

msgid "实现Triton同步指令到HIVM同步指令的转换：`sync_block_all`（全局块同步）；`sync_block_set`（设置同步点）；`sync_block_wait`（等待同步点）"
msgstr "Implementing the conversion of Triton synchronization instructions to HIVM synchronization instructions:<br>• `sync_block_all`: Global block synchronization<br>• `sync_block_set`: Set synchronization point<br>• `sync_block_wait`: Wait for synchronization point"

msgid "triton-to-llvm"
msgstr "triton-to-llvm"

msgid "将Triton中的内联汇编操作 (`extension.inline_assembly`) 转换为LLVM方言的内联汇编，并最终映射为Ascend NPU的CCE硬件固有函数（Intrinsics）"
msgstr "Translate Triton's inline assembly operations (`tl.inline_assembly`) into LLVM dialect inline assembly, and ultimately map them to Ascend NPU's CCE hardware intrinsics."

msgid "ElementwiseInlineAsmOpConversion"
msgstr "ElementwiseInlineAsmOpConversion"

msgid "将 `triton::ElementwiseInlineAsmOp` 转换为 `LLVM::InlineAsmOp` 。"
msgstr "Converts `triton::ElementwiseInlineAsmOp` to `LLVM::InlineAsmOp`."

msgid "3.2.3 SIMT 编译器（Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品）"
msgstr "3.2.3 SIMT Compiler (Ascend 950PR&950DT Series Products)"

msgid "Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品 在 SIMD 路径之外增加 SIMT 能力，用于加速**非结构化 / 离散**访存（如间接索引的 load/store）。 开发者通过 `compile_mode` 选择编译路径。"
msgstr "Ascend 950PR&950DT series products add SIMT capability beyond the SIMD path to accelerate **unstructured/discrete** memory access (such as indirect indexed load/store). Developers select the compilation path via `compile_mode`."

msgid "3.2.3.1 `compile_mode` 说明"
msgstr "3.2.3.1 Explanation of `compile_mode`"

