msgstr "Pure SIMD: structured memory access uses DMA; unstructured access uses scalar loops."

msgid "`Triton IR → Linalg IR → AscendNPU IR`"
msgstr "`Triton IR → Linalg IR → AscendNPU IR`"

msgid "`\"simd_simt_template\"`（**默认**）"
msgstr "`\"simd_simt_template\"` (**default**)"

msgid "混合：结构化仍走 SIMD；离散访存尽量走 SIMT 模板"
msgstr "Hybrid: structured access still uses SIMD; discrete memory access tries to use SIMT templates as much as possible."

msgid "`\"simt_only\"`"
msgstr "`\"simt_only\"`"

msgid "纯 SIMT：直接下发 Triton IR 给NPU IR处理"
msgstr "Pure SIMT: Directly dispatch Triton IR to NPU IR processing."

msgid "`Triton IR → AscendNPU IR`"
msgstr "`Triton IR → AscendNPU IR`"

msgid "用法示例："
msgstr "Usage example:"

msgid "3.2.3.2 三种模式的编译分流"
msgstr "3.2.3.2 Compilation and Distribution for the Three Modes"

msgid "阶段"
msgstr "Stage"

msgid "`\"simd_simt_template\"`"
msgstr "`\"simd_simt_template\"`"

msgid "离散 mask 处理"
msgstr "Discrete mask processing"

msgid "拆成连续/离散边界，用 load + select / store 处理"
msgstr "Split into continuous/discrete boundaries, handle with load + select / store."

msgid "Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品 且张量维数 ≤ 5：标记后交给下游；否则同左"
msgstr "Ascend 950PR&950DT series products and tensor dimension ≤ 5: mark it and pass it downstream; otherwise, same as left."

