msgstr "TritonToLinalg"

msgid "常规 Linalg IR 降级"
msgstr "Standard Linalg IR lowering"

msgid "3.2.3.3 混合模式：只对离散访存走 SIMT"
msgstr "3.2.3.3 Hybrid Mode: Only Discrete Memory Accesses Use SIMT"

msgid "混合模式**不会**把整个 kernel 切到 SIMT，只对离散 / 非结构化访存点走 SIMT，其余仍走 SIMD："
msgstr "Hybrid mode does **not** switch the entire kernel to SIMT; it only uses SIMT for discrete/unstructured memory access points, while the rest continues to use SIMD."

msgid "**离散 mask 处理**"
msgstr "**Discrete mask processing**"

msgid "若判定为非连续 mask，且满足 Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品、混合模式、维数 ≤ 5：不改写 IR，只标记「下游走 SIMT」。"
msgstr "If it is determined to be a non-contiguous mask, and it satisfies Ascend 950PR&950DT series products, mixed mode, and dimension ≤ 5: do not rewrite the IR, only mark \"downstream goes SIMT\"."

msgid "否则（纯 SIMD 或不满足条件）：将 mask 拆成连续 / 离散部分，用连续边界限定全局内存访问，再通过 select 合并结果。"
msgstr "Otherwise (pure SIMD or conditions not met): split the mask into contiguous/discrete parts, use contiguous boundaries to limit global memory access, and then merge the results via select."

msgid "**非结构化访存处理**"
msgstr "**Handling of Unstructured Memory Access**"

msgid "在 Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品 混合模式下，对非结构化访存或已标记的离散访存走 SIMT 快速通道："
msgstr "In Ascend 950PR&950DT series products hybrid mode, unstructured memory access or marked discrete memory access goes through the SIMT fast path:"

msgid "`load` / `store` → `indirect_load` / `indirect_store`（维数 ≤ 5）"
msgstr "`load` / `store` → `indirect_load` / `indirect_store` (dimension ≤ 5)"

msgid "`atomic` 操作 → `hivm.custom(symbol=\"__builtin_indirect_atomic\")`"
msgstr "`atomic` operation → `hivm.custom(symbol=\"__builtin_indirect_atomic\")`"

msgid "不满足条件则回退为标量循环（与 `\"simd\"` 一致）。"
msgstr "If the condition is not met, it falls back to scalar loop (consistent with `\"simd\"`)."

msgid "**TritonToLinalg**"
msgstr "**TritonToLinalg**"

msgid "常规 Linalg IR 降级。"
msgstr "Regular Linalg IR lowering."

msgid "3.2.3.4 纯 SIMT（`simt_only`）"
msgstr "3.2.3.4 Pure SIMT (`simt_only`)"

msgid "`simt_only` 直接下发 Triton IR 交给 AscendNPU IR 做纯 SIMT 编译。"
msgstr "`simt_only` directly dispatches Triton IR to AscendNPU IR for pure SIMT compilation."

msgid "3.2.4 Ascend 亲和算子"
msgstr "3.2.4 Ascend Affinitive Operators"

msgid "为表达标准 Triton 无法覆盖的 Ascend 硬件语义（Cube-Vector 跨核协作、UB 数据搬运、硬件特定访存等），后端在 `triton.language` 上扩展了一组 Ascend 亲和算子。按能力分为三类："
msgstr "To express Ascend Hardware semantics that standard Triton cannot cover (Cube-Vector cross-core collaboration, UB data movement, hardware-specific memory access, etc.), the backend extends a set of Ascend affinitive operators on top of `triton.language`. They are categorized into three types by capability:"

msgid "代表扩展"
msgstr "Representative Extension"

msgid "架构作用"
msgstr "Architectural Role"

msgid "硬件特定数据搬运"
msgstr "Hardware-Specific Data Movement"

msgid "`extension.custom_op`（`index_select` / `index_put`、`gather_out_to_ub` / `scatter_ub_to_out`、`indirect_load` / `indirect_store` 等）"
msgstr "`extension.custom_op` (`index_select` / `index_put`, `gather_out_to_ub` / `scatter_ub_to_out`, `indirect_load` / `indirect_store`, etc.)"

msgid "支持基于索引的 gather/scatter、GM ↔ Unified Buffer 直传、间接地址访存等硬件特定搬运模式，供 SIMD/SIMT 各编译路径复用。"
msgstr "Supports hardware-specific data movement patterns such as index-based gather/scatter, GM ↔ Unified Buffer direct transfer, and indirect address memory access, for reuse across SIMD/SIMT compilation paths."

msgid "编译提示"
msgstr "Compilation Hint"

msgid "`extension.compile_hint`"
msgstr "tl.compile_hint"

msgid "向编译器传递硬件特定提示，指导后端优化策略、资源分配与内核配置。"
msgstr "Pass hardware-specific compilation hints to the compiler to guide backend optimization strategies, resource allocation, or kernel configuration."

msgid "跨核块同步"
msgstr "Cross-Core Block Synchronization"

msgid "`extension.sync_block_wait` / `extension.sync_block_set` / `extension.sync_block_all`"
msgstr "`extension.sync_block_wait` / `extension.sync_block_set` / `extension.sync_block_all`"

msgid "显式协调 Cube-Vector 架构下的核间执行顺序与数据依赖：点对点等待 / 通知，以及按模式广播的全局块同步。"
msgstr "Explicitly coordinates inter-core execution order and data dependencies under the Cube-Vector architecture: point-to-point wait / notify, and global block synchronization by mode broadcast."

msgid "各扩展的函数签名、参数取值、使用限制与示例以 Python API 参考为准（避免与架构文档两处维护）：见 [triton.language.extra.cann.extension](https://triton-ascend.readthedocs.io/zh-cn/latest/python-api/triton.language.extra.cann.extension.html)——索引/gather/scatter 等搬运类见 *Vector/Memory Extension Ops*、自定义算子机制见 *Custom Ops*、跨核同步见 *Synchronization*、编译提示与多缓冲见 *Core Types*。"
msgstr "For the function signatures, parameter values, usage restrictions, and examples of each extension, refer to the Python API reference (to avoid maintaining them in both the architecture document and the API reference): see [triton.language.extra.cann.extension](https://triton-ascend.readthedocs.io/zh-cn/latest/python-api/triton.language.extra.cann.extension.html) — for index/gather/scatter and other data movement operations, see *Vector/Memory Extension Ops*; for the custom operator mechanism, see *Custom Ops*; for cross-core synchronization, see *Synchronization*; for compilation hints and multi-buffer, see *Core Types*."
